e son régulateur de vitesse électronique sur 130 km/h. Au moment où une dernière bourde de Ben, le beau‐père, pousse Julia, excédée, à demander qu’on fasse demi‐tour, Tom s’aperçoit qu’il ne contrôle plus son véhicule. L’électronique de bord ne répond plus, la vitesse est bloquée à 130 km/h. Toutes les manœuvres pour ralentir la voiture emballée restent sans effet. Une voiture folle, six passagers au bord de la crise de nerfs et un embouteillage monstre qui les attend à moins de deux cents kilomètres de là…","tagline":"Ce devait être des vacances tranquilles en famille…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2pDRc9uygZbDG51U1VFXlCfmrww.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t5p87zY3MKSOHFIwOBbwmjxA5rS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":382598,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2pDRc9uygZbDG51U1VFXlCfmrww.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2pDRc9uygZbDG51U1VFXlCfmrww.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2pDRc9uygZbDG51U1VFXlCfmrww.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2pDRc9uygZbDG51U1VFXlCfmrww.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AiXQZIQW35RREmTs5nHqSvQV6WM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AiXQZIQW35RREmTs5nHqSvQV6WM.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrExpoA2E2bCrSZ6VPWHHdzY2y.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hrExpoA2E2bCrSZ6VPWHHdzY2y.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrExpoA2E2bCrSZ6VPWHHdz